     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div><br></div><div>I am creating a Shiny app the output of which is really a table of 7 rows and 7 columns.  </div><div><br></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\">The first row contains some inputs boxes and returned data across three columns</font></div><div><font color=\"#b45f06\">The second row are input assumptions for mortgage prepayment rates</font></div><div><font color=\"#ff00ff\">The third through ninth rows are return values for each scenario</font></div><div><font color=\"#b45f06\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">I need to place a label on rows 3 though 9, Life CPR, Yield, WAL, M.Duration, First Pmt, Last Pmt, Spread.  Does anyone know how to do this?</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">Glenn</font></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">library(shiny)</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"># Define UI for application for mortgage bond yield table analysis</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">shinyUI(fluidPage(</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">titlePanel(&quot;Bond Lab Yield Table Analytics&quot;),</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">fluidRow( height = &quot;20%&quot;,</span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">#column(1), # This column just makes some space</span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">column(4,</span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">h4(&quot;Bond Data&quot;),</span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">textInput(inputId = &quot;cusip&quot;, label = &quot;CUISP or ID&quot;, value =&quot;&quot;,</span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">width = &#39;200&#39;, placeholder = NULL),</span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">textInput(inputId = &quot;price&quot;, label = &quot;Pricing&quot;, value =&quot;&quot;,</span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">width = &#39;200&#39;, placeholder = NULL),</span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">textInput(inputId = &quot;tradedate&quot;, label = &quot;Trade Date&quot;, </span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">value = Sys.Date(), width =&#39;200&#39;, placeholder = NULL),</span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">textInput(inputId = &quot;settlement&quot;, label = &quot;Settlement Date&quot;, </span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">value = &quot;&quot;, width = &#39;200&#39;, placeholder = NULL)</span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">),</span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">#column(1), # This column just makes some space</span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">column(3,</span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">h4(&quot;Pricing Data&quot;),</span><br style=\"font-family:SFNSText,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvet